  "question": {
    "text": "A nucleus with $\\mathrm{Z}=92$ emits the following in a sequence:\n$\\alpha, \\beta^{-}, \\beta^{-} \\alpha, \\alpha, \\alpha, \\alpha, \\alpha, \\beta^{-}, \\beta^{-}, \\alpha, \\beta^{+}, \\beta^{+}, \\alpha$. Then $\\mathrm{Z}$ of the resulting nucleus is",
